{
 "$comment": "Records a PRODUCER must never emit: each must fail contracts/raw-2.schema.json. `reader` says what the analyzer does when it meets the record: \"schema\" = accepted or ignored by the tolerant reader (only the schema catches it); \"invalid-record\" = counted as invalid → `affected` answers run all; \"integrity\" = integrity problem → run all; \"error\" = load error (exit 2).",
